{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","number":2,"title":"Nebensätze: weil / da & obwohl","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Ich habe keinen Bock mehr zu zelten","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Wieso nicht","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Weil es draußen so kalt ist","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Da es kalt ist bleiben wir lieber drinnen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Obwohl es kalt ist will ich an den Strand","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Wirklich Obwohl der Himmel so grau ist","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":7,"text":"Ja Da wir sowieso hier sind sollten wir wenigstens spazieren gehen","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":8,"text":"Also gut obwohl ich lieber im Auto bleibe komme ich mit","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"