x":1,"sub":3,"text":"Obwohl es regnet, gehen wir spazieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"Grundstruktur: Nebensatz mit Verb am Ende","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":2,"sub":1,"text":"Ich lerne Deutsch, weil ich in Deutschland arbeiten möchte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"weil — der neutrale, alltägliche Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":2,"sub":2,"text":"Max war enttäuscht, weil sein Eimer weg war.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"weil — der neutrale, alltägliche Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":2,"sub":3,"text":"Wir bleiben zu Hause, weil es regnet.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"weil — der neutrale, alltägliche Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":1,"text":"Da ich krank bin, bleibe ich heute zu Hause.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"da — der formelle, bereits bekannte Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":2,"text":"Da mein Chef den Text wollte, habe ich die ganze Nacht gearbeitet.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"da — der formelle, bereits bekannte Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":3,"sub":3,"text":"Da wir schon einmal dort waren, kennen wir die Wiese.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"da — der formelle, bereits bekannte Grund","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":1,"text":"Obwohl es regnet, gehen wir spazieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"obwohl — der unerwartete Gegensatz","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":2,"text":"Obwohl das stressig klingt, hast du es geschafft.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"obwohl — der unerwartete Gegensatz","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"grammar","type":"grammar-example","idx":4,"sub":3,"text":"Obwohl so viel schiefgegangen ist, war die Reise toll.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","block":"obwohl — der unerwartete Gegensatz","control":".example-line[click]","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Letztes Jahr hatten Max und Rohan einen Strandurlaub geplant Da das Wetter perfekt war mieteten sie ein kleines Boot Obwohl Max noch nie ein Boot gefahren war wollte er es unbedingt versuchen Sie machten das Boot am Steg fest und fuhren los Weil die Wellen hoch waren fiel Max plötzlich sein Eimer ins Meer Er war total enttäuscht da er den Eimer sehr gemocht hatte Obwohl so viel schiefgegangen war blieben die Freunde fröhlich und nannten die Fahrt ihr größtes Abenteuer","authoredText":"Letztes Jahr hatten Max und Rohan einen Strandurlaub geplant. Da das Wetter perfekt war, mieteten sie ein kleines Boot. Obwohl Max noch nie ein Boot gefahren war, wollte er es unbedingt versuchen. Sie machten das Boot am Steg fest und fuhren los. Weil die Wellen hoch waren, fiel Max plötzlich sein Eimer ins Meer. Er war total enttäuscht, da er den Eimer sehr gemocht hatte. Obwohl so viel schiefgegangen war, blieben die Freunde fröhlich und nannten die Fahrt ihr größtes Abenteuer.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Ein Abenteuer am Strand","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Kommst du morgen wirklich mit an den Strand, obwohl es nur zwölf Grad hat?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ehrlich?","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Ich weiß noch nicht.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Da es so kalt ist, habe ich eigentlich keine Lust mehr.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Schade.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Ich gehe trotzdem, weil ich diese Woche einfach mal raus muss.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":7,"text":"Na gut — wenn du mir versprichst, dass wir danach etwas Warmes trinken, komme ich doch mit.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Kommst du morgen wirklich mit an den Strand, obwohl es nur zwölf Grad hat?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ehrlich? Ich weiß noch nicht. Da es so kalt ist, habe ich eigentlich keine Lust mehr.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Schade. Ich gehe trotzdem, weil ich diese Woche einfach mal raus muss.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Na gut — wenn du mir versprichst, dass wir danach etwas Warmes trinken, komme ich doch mit.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_002_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich komme mit, obwohl es kalt ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt, ob du morgen an den Strand mitkommst. Es hat zwölf Grad.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Da es so kalt ist, habe ich keine Lust mehr.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Dein Freund fragt, warum du keine Lust mehr hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Weil es nicht in den Kofferraum passt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, warum du das Boot nicht mitnimmst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Ich bin enttäuscht, weil der Ausflug mehrfach schiefgegangen ist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Deine Kollegin fragt, warum du enttäuscht bist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Obwohl es regnet, gehe ich spazieren.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt, warum du trotzdem spazieren gehst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":6,"text":"Da ich Bock auf ein Abenteuer habe, fahre ich mit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-2-nebensaetze-weil-da-obwohl","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":6,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, warum du das Abenteuer machst.","voiceRole":"narrator-f